{"id":"adjective-preposition","lv":"a2","n":31,"cat":"prepositions","t":"Good at, afraid of, interested in + V-ing","en":"good at · afraid of · interested in","sum":"Nhiều tính từ đi kèm một giới từ cố định, phải học theo cụm: good at, bad at, interested in, afraid of, scared of, proud of, tired of, worried about, excited about, famous for, kind to, angry with (ai) / about (việc gì). Sau giới từ, động từ thêm -ing: good at swimming, interested in learning. Tiếng Việt “giỏi về”, “sợ về” dễ dẫn tới giới từ sai (good in, afraid about).","forms":[{"f":"tính từ + giới từ cố định","vi":"good at · afraid of · interested in"},{"f":"giới từ + V-ing","vi":"good at swimming · interested in learning"},{"f":"worried about · excited about · proud of · famous for","vi":"học theo cụm"}],"pts":[{"id":"adjective-preposition","name":"Adjective + preposition","vi":"Good at, afraid of, interested in (+ V-ing)"}],"cast":{"zoe":{"name":{"en":"Zoe","vi":"Zoe"},"look":"teengirl","style":{"top":"#E0607E","topShade":"#C44B68","accent":"#C44B68","hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#8B5A2B"},"x":560},"linh":{"name":{"en":"Linh","vi":"Linh"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#9A6FC4","topShade":"#8159AA","accent":"#8159AA","hair":"bob","hairColor":"#1C1716","skin":"#F2CFAE","skinShade":"#E0B592"},"x":1040}},"bg":"mountain-night","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Linh, are you afraid of the dark?","vi":"Chị Linh, chị có sợ bóng tối không?","ipa":["lɪn","ɑɹ","ju","əˈfɹeɪd","ʌv","ðə","dɑɹk"],"who":"zoe","ann":{"expression":"worried"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":2.294,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.687],[2,0.864],[3,1.068],[4,1.489],[5,1.625],[6,1.774]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"No, but I'm afraid of spiders!","vi":"Không, nhưng chị sợ nhện!","ipa":["noʊ","bʌt","aɪm","əˈfɹeɪd","ʌv","ˈspaɪdɚz"],"who":"linh","ann":{"expression":"surprised"},"b":1,"start":3.084,"end":5.114,"timing":[[0,3.084],[1,3.623],[2,3.786],[3,3.909],[4,4.276],[5,4.371]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Me too. I'm not good at